:: Attraction Attitudes [nobr]

If you are set as “Attracted” to an NPC, your character may have lewds thoughts about them and special responses may appear in certain events. Certain choices in the NPC’s story may lock the Attraction.<br>
<br>
<strong>Family:</strong><br>

<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>:
<<if $Attractions.Dad == 0>>
	<span class="coral"><<link "Not Attracted">>
    	<<set $Attractions.Dad to 1>>
        <<goto "Attitudes Menu">>
    <</link>>
    </span>
<<elseif $Attractions.Dad == 1>>
	<span class="pink"><<link "Attracted">>
    	<<set $Attractions.Dad to 0>>
        <<goto "Attitudes Menu">>
    <</link>>
    </span>
<</if>><br>

